5. Ball trajectory fidelity: For any spin vector and speed combination, in‑flight curvature error ≤5% compared to Earth‑equivalent Magnus trajectory.
6. System latency: All active components meet their respective latency budgets (ball state change <2.5 ms, pitch field rise <3 ms, vest torque onset <15 ms post‑trigger).

